Content:
Personally, I don't think Phenonaman is bad, he just speaks in a weird alien type way and was a bit rude calling Robert small but he seems nice, 

if anything Blonde Blazer made me feel a bit off, since she did lead Robert on, nd squeezing his arm and checking him, all while knowing she had a boyfriend, and if she does end up getting with Robert will she just do the same to him if someone better showed up, 

she just suspicious and it seem more like their trying to make it seem like Phenoaman is a problem, in my opinion, but we'll just have to wait and see if Phenomaman is a bad bf or not. I honestly hope not, I like him.
